SELECT define_provision($q$RRC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2015@2025-03-28$q$, $q$Table 6.2.1.3.2 AO13.1$q$, 'ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME', $q$AO13.1
Minimum setbacks are in accordance with the following:
- carports and garages are set back a minimum of six (6) metres from all road frontages;
- building walls are set back a minimum of three (3) metres from all road frontages;
- verandahs are set back a minimum of one (1) metre from all road frontages;
- the side boundary setback is a minimum of:
- 1.5 metres for a wall up to 4.5 metres high; or
- two (2) metres for a wall up to 7.5 metres high; or
